  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FATA Infrastructure Project (FIP): Schools in Orakzai, 5 School in Kurram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FATA Infrastructure Project (FIP) constructs roads to connect remote communities to markets and facilitate access to essential services; restores electricity infrastructure; and improves access to water for drinking and farming. This portion is supporting FATA Tribal Areas, Widen and Improver Ghilijo Dabori Rd.</narrative>
  </description>
